guide forever/horde/30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills
title Hillsbrad Foothills
faction Horde
levels 29-31
zone Hillsbrad Foothills
next forever/horde/30-40/02-thousand-needles
pitch For characters of 29 to 31: the Battle of Hillsbrad, Tarren Mill's errands and the gnolls of the foothills, all at or under your level.

# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: The Swarm Grows (1145, 1146), and from the 22-25 Hillsbrad guide Battle of Hillsbrad
# (529), Dangerous! (567), Elixir of Agony (509, 513); Soothing Turtle Bisque (7321, Christoph
# Jeffcoat in Tarren Mill: the Snapjaws (29) of the river south of Tarren Mill drop the meat, and he
# sells the spices).
# Left out: Regthar Deathgate (1361), To Steal From Thieves (1164), Helcular's Revenge's second part
# (553), Elixir of Agony's alchemy part (515, 517, 524), Scout Support and Valuable Vantages (98094,
# 98095: the western vial goes on the Alterac peak among Ferocious Yetis 31-32 and Mountain Lions
# 32-34, two to four over players at about 29.5; 33 of the 34 recorded players placed it on that top).

# Horde 30-40 in the order the zones' quest levels fit (2026-11-07 re-order; level tidy 2026-11-15):
# Hillsbrad's 26-31 quests at 30-31, the Shimmering Flats and Desolace at 33-36, Stranglethorn at
# 34-36, Dustwallow at 36-38, Alterac and Arathi at 38-39, the Badlands at 39-40.
#
# Level tidy (2026-11-15, players' recorded levels): at 30-32 on this visit, Tarren Mill's 33-36
# quests sent players at mobs two to five levels over them (Kegan Darkmar 35 at the Dalaran crater,
# the Syndicate 32-34 around Valik, the Boulderfist ogres and Witherbark trolls 32-35, Silky
# Sutures at 36), with recorded deaths at each. Their work now comes on the 38-39 visit
# (forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands), which works Tarren Mill and Hammerfall anyway:
# Prison Break In, Stone Tokens and Key to the City (544, 556, 93680), Infiltration (533, with
# Valik), and the whole Hammerfall chain (655, 672-675, 676-677, Silky Sutures 97539). The five
# offered in Tarren Mill (533, 544, 556, 93680, 676) are taken on this guide's last Tarren Mill stop
# and carried, so nobody walks back to the givers later. Helcular's
# Revenge (552) stays: the rod drops from the Cave and Ferocious Yetis (30-32) of the Foothill
# Caverns, on the way to the town hall. Its second part (553) left the route: two of its flames are
# among the Mountain and Giant Yetis (32-34) and Frostmaw (37), and it ends at Helcular's grave in
# Southshore's graveyard, between level 55 guards (#1925).
# In their place, quests at your level from the 22-25 Hillsbrad guide (agreed with its slice):
# Battle of Hillsbrad 529 (the smithy), Dangerous! (567, from the poster) and Lydon's Elixir of
# Agony (509, the Mudsnout blossoms; 513 goes to Faranell on the Undercity stop at the end).
#
# Flow: Freewind Post (where the previous guide ends) -> fly to the Crossroads (Korran) ->
# Orgrimmar (Belgrom, training) -> zeppelin to the Undercity -> fly to Tarren Mill -> south along the
# river (Snapjaws) to the Mudsnout blossoms -> north-east of Southshore and west to Hillsbrad's
# smithy -> Tarren Mill (Darthalia, Lydon) -> the yeti caves and the town hall -> Tarren Mill -> the
# Azurelode Mine -> Tarren Mill -> fly to the
# Undercity (Faranell, training), where the next guide takes the Orgrimmar zeppelin.
#
# Catch-up (#1660): a character who skipped forever/horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills arrives without
# Darthalia's first Battle of Hillsbrad parts (527, 528) and Krusk's The Rescue (498).
# For that character the guide does them first, from Tarren Mill, in the 22-25 guide's order: the
# fields, Tarren Mill, the peasants, Tarren Mill, Durnholde Keep. Each of those steps is shown only
# until its chain's last quest (529, 498) is handed in, so a character who did the 22-25 guide sees
# only Battle of Hillsbrad 529 (#1776: Farmer Kalaba and Citizen Wilkes for Dangerous! with it).
#
# City of Dalaran (`when dungeon "City of Dalaran"`, dungeons in the route): for a character who runs it,
# Melisara's The Grave Knight (96986) is taken on a Tarren Mill stop at about 30.5,
# the run goes through the sewer pipe north-west of the Dalaran crater
# (Alterac 12.8,62.2, where players' recordings go in, Horde characters without the Dalaran Sewer Key
# among them: the key comes only with Heart of Disruption, 96984, after Dalaran Patrols on the 38-39
# visit), and Melisara takes it back on the next Tarren Mill stop (`when dungeon`, `when complete`). Rexxie Copperclutch's
# Opportunistic Education (96987) starts and ends inside (the run tip names it). Left out: Source of Power
# (96988: Doctor Martin Felben in the Undercity, level 33, 3.5 levels over on the Undercity stop at 29.5)
# and Heart of Disruption (96984: after Blood in the Streets, 92434, on the 38-39 visit).
#
# Class quests and training:
# - Druids train in Thunder Bluff on the flight from Freewind Post; Paladins with Garen Largo in
#   the Undercity; everyone else in Orgrimmar. At about 31, the Undercity at the end of the
#   guide trains Warriors, Paladins, Rogues, Priests, Mages and Warlocks; Hunters, Shamans and
#   Druids train at the start of the next guide.
# - Shaman: Call of Water (220) goes to Islen Waterseer by Ratchet on the way, the Brazier of
#   Everfount from the Undercity (Silverpine, the Sepulcher), and the Shard of Water back to
#   Islen in the next guide. Call of Air (1531) is offered from level 30: Searn Firewarder gives
#   it on the next guide's Orgrimmar stop (about 31), not on this one's (29.4), and Prate
#   Cloudseer by Freewind Post takes it later in that guide.
# - Warlock: the Felhunter chain is forever/class/warlock/felhunter-horde.
#
# Skyborne: Exploring the Horde (93739) is handed to Thrall on the Orgrimmar stop, optional.
#
# Hearthstone: it stays bound at Freewind Post (forever/horde/07-ashenvale's bind); this guide sets none.
# The next guide leaves the Undercity by zeppelin for Orgrimmar.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- To Orgrimmar

step Freewind Post flight master
  zone Thousand Needles
  goto 45.0,49.1 "Freewind Post flight master"

step Thunder Bluff
  only Druid
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Fly from Freewind Post to Thunder Bluff and train with Turak Runetotem on Elder Rise; fly on to the Crossroads from there.
  fly "Thunder Bluff"
  train class

step Ratchet
  only Shaman
  zone The Barrens
  tip Fly from Freewind Post to Ratchet. Islen Waterseer camps on the coast a short walk south of the town; fly on to the Crossroads from Ratchet.
  fly "Ratchet"
  turnin 220 reward 6637              -- Islen Waterseer: your Water Sapta, for the brazier
  accept 63

step Fly to the Crossroads
  only Druid
  zone Thunder Bluff
  goto 46.7,49.9 "Thunder Bluff flight master"
  fly "Crossroads"
  zone The Barrens

step Fly to the Crossroads
  only Shaman
  zone The Barrens
  goto 63.1,37.1 "Ratchet flight master"
  fly "Crossroads"

step Fly to the Crossroads
  only Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Paladin,Mage,Warlock
  zone Thousand Needles
  fly "Crossroads"
  zone The Barrens

step Korran
  when level>=29
  zone The Barrens
  tip Korran stands beside the Crossroads flight master. The Swarm Grows is offered from level 29; below it, the next guide's Orgrimmar stop takes it.
  accept 1145                         -- Korran: for Belgrom Rockmaul in Orgrimmar

step Fly to Orgrimmar
  zone The Barrens
  goto 51.5,30.4 "Crossroads flight master"
  fly "Orgrimmar"
  zone Orgrimmar

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Orgrimmar

step Thrall
  only Skyborne
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Thrall waits in Grommash Hold, in the Valley of Wisdom.
  turnin 93739 optional               -- Thrall, Grommash Hold, if you carry it

step Train
  zone Orgrimmar
  only Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock
  tip Train your new spells.
  train class

step Belgrom Rockmaul
  when onquest 1145
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Belgrom Rockmaul stands in the Valley of Honor, on the way out to the main gate.
  turnin 1145                         -- Belgrom Rockmaul
  accept 1146                         -- for Moktar Krin in the Shimmering Flats, next guide

step Zeppelin to Undercity
  zone Durotar
  goto 50.8,13.5 "Zeppelin to Undercity"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Undercity

step Garen Largo
  only Paladin
  zone Undercity
  tip Garen Largo trains Paladins in the Undercity.
  train class

step Undercity flight master
  only Shaman
  zone Undercity
  goto 63.1,48.3 "Undercity flight master"

step Brazier of Everfount
  only Shaman
  zone Silverpine Forest
  tip Fly to the Sepulcher. The Brazier of Everfount stands on the hill just south-west of it: beat the Corrupt Manifestation of Water beside it, place its bracers in the brazier, speak to the Minor Manifestation of Water and keep the Shard of Water for Islen. Fly on to Tarren Mill from the Sepulcher.
  fly "The Sepulcher"
  use 6637 quest 63.1 @38.5,44.4 map 1421 -- Water Sapta: drink it by the standing stone to see the elemental
  collect 7812 quest 63.1
  turnin 63                           -- Brazier of Everfount
  accept 100
  turnin 100                          -- Minor Manifestation of Water
  accept 96                           -- for Islen Waterseer, next guide

step Fly to Tarren Mill
  only Shaman
  zone Silverpine Forest
  goto 45.6,42.4 "The Sepulcher flight master"
  fly "Tarren Mill"
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills

step Fly to Tarren Mill
  only !Shaman
  zone Undercity
  goto 63.1,48.3 "Undercity flight master"
  fly "Tarren Mill"
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Tarren Mill

step Tarren Mill
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip The Dangerous! poster hangs by the inn; Apothecary Lydon stands inside it. Christoph Jeffcoat, the cook by the inn, wants turtle meat and sells the spices for it.
  accept 567                          -- Dangerous!, the poster by the inn
  accept 509                          -- Apothecary Lydon, inside
  accept 7321                         -- Christoph Jeffcoat: Soothing Turtle Bisque, the Snapjaws of the river south of town
  buy 3713 npc 2393                   -- Soothing Spices, from Christoph Jeffcoat

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Catch-up: the Battle of Hillsbrad and The Rescue

step High Executor Darthalia
  when !turnedin 528
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip You missed Darthalia's first errands, from the 22-25 Hillsbrad guide: they come first now. They are a few levels below you and quick, and they open the rest of the Battle of Hillsbrad in this guide.
  accept 527                          -- High Executor Darthalia

step Krusk
  when !turnedin 498
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Krusk wants his two scouts freed from Durnholde Keep.
  accept 498                          -- Krusk, inside

step Hillsbrad Fields
  when !turnedin 528
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip West past the hills to the farms east of Hillsbrad town. Farmer Ray works the field by the northern farmhouse, Farmer Getz the one further south-east; Farmhands and Farmers are everywhere.
  tip Careful: Kirin Tor Guards (55) patrol Hillsbrad's fields and roads and attack the Horde: keep an eye out for them and stay out of their way.
  kill 2266 quest 527.1
  kill 2360 quest 527.2
  kill 232 quest 527.3
  kill 2403 quest 527.4

step Tarren Mill
  when !turnedin 528
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Back east to Tarren Mill.
  turnin 527                          -- High Executor Darthalia
  accept 528

step Hillsbrad Peasants
  when !turnedin 528
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Back to the fields: the Peasants work south of the farmhouses. Careful: A fleeing peasant that reaches the town hall can bring back adds; snares or roots keep them from escaping.
  kill 2267 quest 528.1

step Tarren Mill
  when !turnedin 528
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  turnin 528                          -- High Executor Darthalia

step High Executor Darthalia
  when !turnedin 529
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  accept 529                          -- High Executor Darthalia

step Durnholde Keep
  when !turnedin 498
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip South-east of Tarren Mill. Drull and Tog'thar are chained in the keep's courtyard buildings: Jailor Eston carries the Dull Iron Key and Jailor Marlgen the Burnished Gold Key, both in the keep. Kill them, then open both locks.
  interact 1721 quest 498.1           -- Drull's ball and chain
  interact 1722 quest 498.2           -- Tog'thar's ball and chain

step Krusk
  when !turnedin 498
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Back to Tarren Mill.
  turnin 498                          -- Krusk, inside

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- South: the river and the Mudsnout gnolls

step The river south of Tarren Mill: kill these as you meet them
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip South from Tarren Mill along the river: Snapjaws (29) sun themselves on its banks all the way down to the hills above Southshore. Some of them carry Turtle Meat.
  collect 3712 quest 7321.1 @67.8,28.0 map 1424 -- Turtle Meat, from the Snapjaws

step Mudsnout Blossoms
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip South of the river's bend, the Mudsnout gnolls (26-28) camp in the hills above Dun Garok; the blossoms grow among their tents. The Shamans heal and call their friends: pull them first.
  collect 3502 quest 509 @64.2,61.4 map 1424 -- Mudsnout Blossoms

step North of Southshore
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip From the blossoms, back north along the river and then west to Hillsbrad town, well north of Southshore (its guards are 55).
  goto 60.0,42.0 map 1424 "North of Southshore"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The smithy and the fields

step The smithy
  when !turnedin 529
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip West across the foothills to Hillsbrad town: the smithy stands in the middle of it. Blacksmith Verringtan and his apprentices work at the forge; the Shipment of Iron is stacked beside it. Citizen Wilkes walks by the smithy; Farmer Kalaba works the field south-east of the town.
  kill 2404 quest 529.1
  kill 2265 quest 529.2
  collect 3564 quest 529.3            -- Inside
  kill 2449 quest 567.2
  kill 2451 quest 567.4

step Tarren Mill
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Back east to Tarren Mill.
  turnin 529                          -- High Executor Darthalia
  accept 532
  turnin 509                          -- Apothecary Lydon, inside
  accept 513                          -- for Master Apothecary Faranell, on the Undercity stop at the end of this guide
  accept 552                          -- Novice Thaivand, in the town: Helcular's Rod, from the yetis on the way to the town hall

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The yeti caves and the town hall

step Helcular's Rod
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip West of Tarren Mill, the Cave and Ferocious Yetis (30-32) fill the Foothill Caverns in the hills; about one in sixteen carries the rod. Stay in these caverns: the Mountain and Giant Yetis (32-34) of the cave further north carry it too, but they hit hard and come in pairs.
  collect 3708 quest 552 @44.5,29.4

step Town hall
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip On to Hillsbrad town, south-west of the yeti caves. The town hall is on the town's west side: Magistrate Burnside (30) and Clerk Horrace Whitesteed are inside with the Town Registry; the Proclamation is pinned up beside it. Councilmen walk the town.
  kill 2387 quest 532.2
  interact 1761 quest 532.3           -- Hillsbrad Proclamation, inside
  collect 3657 quest 532.4            -- Inside
  kill 2448 quest 567.1               -- Inside
  kill 2335 quest 532.1               -- Inside

step Tarren Mill
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Back east to Tarren Mill.
  turnin 532                          -- High Executor Darthalia
  accept 539
  turnin 552                          -- Novice Thaivand
  note Thaivand's next errand, the flames, sends you among the Mountain and Giant Yetis (32-34) and to Helcular's grave inside Southshore: leave it.

step Melisara
  when dungeon "City of Dalaran"
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip For your City of Dalaran run, later in this guide: Melisara stands in Tarren Mill, a short walk east of Magus Wordeen Voidglare.
  accept 96986                        -- Melisara

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The mine

step City of Dalaran
  when dungeon "City of Dalaran"
  when onquest 96986
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip The City of Dalaran is a dungeon for a group of five, about levels 28 to 33, under the violet dome. Without the Dalaran Sewer Key, go in through the sewer pipe north-west of the crater: the arrow leads there.
  tip Inside: Atrexis the Grave Knight is Melisara's. Rexxie Copperclutch, in the sewer, gives Opportunistic Education and takes it back there.
  enter "City of Dalaran" @12.8,62.2 live
  complete 96986 @12.8,62.2 live      -- The Grave Knight: Atrexis, inside

step Hillsbrad Foothills
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  goto 28.5,55.0 "Azurelode Mine"

step Azurelode Mine
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Head south-west past Hillsbrad town to the Azurelode Mine. Miners work the tunnels; Foreman Bonds (30) and Miner Hackett (29) are deep inside.
  kill 2269 quest 539.2
  kill 2450 quest 567.3
  kill 2305 quest 539.1               -- Inside Azurelode Mine

step Level 30
  when level<30
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Magus Wordeen Voidglare's quests on the next Tarren Mill stop and Alliance Relations in Orgrimmar, the next guide's first stop, are offered from level 30. Short of 30? Keep killing the Hillsbrad Miners and Foremen (26-28) in the Azurelode Mine until level 30. Or, with a group, run the City of Dalaran dungeon instead.
  goto 29.7,55.4 map 1424 "Hillsbrad Foremen"
  level 30 grind 2503                 -- grind on Hillsbrad Foreman

step Finish the Turtle Meat
  when onquest 7321
  when !has 3712 x10
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Still short of ten Turtle Meat? The Snapjaws line the river east of Tarren Mill, on your way back from the mine.
  collect 3712 quest 7321.1 @68.0,24.0 map 1424

step Tarren Mill
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip North-east back to Tarren Mill, passing well north of Southshore (its guards are 55).
  turnin 7321                         -- Christoph Jeffcoat
  turnin 539                          -- High Executor Darthalia: her next Battle of Hillsbrad, and Deathguard Humbert's sword, are elite group quests at Dun Garok: take them only with a group
  turnin 567
  accept 533                          -- Krusk, inside: Infiltration, worked on the 38-39 visit (its Syndicate are 32-35)
  note Keep Infiltration in your log: its Syndicate (32-35) are over you now, and the 38-39 guide (Alterac and Arathi) works it on its first Tarren Mill loop.

step Voidglare, Bel'varil and Tallow
  when level>=30
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Magus Wordeen Voidglare and Keeper Bel'varil are inside the inn, Tallow just outside it. Their quests are offered from level 30; below it, the 38-39 guide's first Tarren Mill stop takes them.
  accept 544                          -- Magus Wordeen Voidglare, inside: Prison Break In, for the 38-39 visit (the Dalaran crater's traitors are 33-35)
  accept 93680                        -- Magus Wordeen Voidglare: Key to the City, with Prison Break In on the 38-39 visit
  accept 556                          -- Keeper Bel'varil, inside: Stone Tokens, with the crater on the 38-39 visit
  accept 676                          -- Tallow, outside the inn: the Boulderfist ogres (32-34) on the 38-39 Arathi visit
  note Keep these in your log: their camps are two to four levels over you now, and the 38-39 guide works them on its first Tarren Mill loop and in Hammerfall.

step Melisara
  when dungeon "City of Dalaran"
  when complete 96986
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip The Grave Knight from your City of Dalaran run: Melisara, a short walk east of Magus Wordeen Voidglare.
  turnin 96986                        -- Melisara

step Battle of Hillsbrad with a group
  when group 541
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Darthalia's last battle is at Dun Garok, the dwarven keep south-east of Southshore: every dwarf there is elite (28-32), Captain Ironhill too. Great XP if you have a group for it.
  accept 541                          -- High Executor Darthalia

step Humbert's Sword with a group
  when group 547
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Deathguard Humbert's sword drops from the same Dun Garok dwarves (about one in twelve).
  accept 547                          -- Deathguard Humbert

step Dun Garok
  when onquest 541,547
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Clear Dun Garok from the gate in; the dwarves run for help at 30% health.
  kill 2344 quest 541.1 @71.2,79.0 map 1424
  kill 2345 quest 541.2 @71.0,78.3 map 1424
  kill 2346 quest 541.3 @71.6,79.2 map 1424
  kill 2304 quest 541.4 @72.2,79.8 map 1424
  collect 3693 quest 547 @71.2,79.0 map 1424

step Tarren Mill
  when onquest 541
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  turnin 541                          -- High Executor Darthalia
  accept 550                          -- for Varimathras in the Undercity, at the end of this guide

step Deathguard Humbert
  when onquest 547
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  turnin 547                          -- Deathguard Humbert

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Undercity

step Fly to Undercity
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  goto 60.1,18.6 "Tarren Mill flight master"
  fly "Undercity"
  zone Undercity

step Master Apothecary Faranell
  zone Undercity
  tip Master Apothecary Faranell stands in the Apothecarium, in the Royal Quarter.
  turnin 513                          -- Master Apothecary Faranell
  note Faranell's next Elixir of Agony needs a Lesser Troll's Blood Elixir (Alchemy) and the Hillsbrad coast: leave it.

step Varimathras
  when onquest 550
  zone Undercity
  tip Varimathras stands beside Sylvanas in the Royal Quarter.
  turnin 550                          -- Varimathras: Darthalia's commendation

step Calder Gray
  when group 97985
  zone Undercity
  tip Calder Gray stands in the Apothecarium. His Thundering Hearts is for Stormheart, a level 30 elite who walks the canyon east of Freewind Post, on the next guide's way to the Shimmering Flats.
  accept 97985                        -- Calder Gray: back to him on the next Undercity stop, at about 38

step Undercity trainers
  only Warrior,Paladin,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock
  zone Undercity
  tip Train while you are in the Undercity: the trainers stand in the War Quarter, the Rogues' Quarter and the Magic Quarter (Paladins: Garen Largo).
  train class
